<section class="pillars" id="pillars">
    <div class="pillar-item">
        <h3>Record Review & Translation</h3>
        <p>I review every page of your medical records and translate complex pathology, staging, and treatment options into plain language for your family.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar-item">
        <h3>Second Opinion Coordination</h3>
        <p>I identify lead institutions in specific specialties and facilitate rapid second opinions to ensure no protocol is overlooked.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar-item">
        <h3>Provider Communication</h3>
        <p>I communicate directly with your care team in peer-to-peer clinical language, ensuring that nothing is lost in translation during brief appointments.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar-item">
        <h3>Appointment Navigation</h3>
        <p>I prepare you before every appointment and debrief with you after, ensuring you understand every option presented by your specialists.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .pillars {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 8rem 5%;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 4rem;
    }

    .pillar-item {
        padding-bottom: 3rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(10, 34, 64, 0.1);
    }

    .pillar-item h3 {
        font-size: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .pillar-item p {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .pillars {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 2.5rem;
            padding: 4rem 5%;
        }
        .pillar-item {
            padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .pillar-item h3 {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
        }
    }
</style>